  "title": "When You’re Tempted to Ignore an Issue: - Ask Yourself:",
  "description": "When you’re tempted to ignore an issue: - Ask yourself: \"What’s the worst that could happen if I address this now?\" - Take a small step: Do one action to start handling the problem (e.g., send an email, gather info). - Reward bravery: Celebrate facing issues instead of avoiding them. Example: Avoiding a financial review? Start by checking one account and build momentum from there.",
